2
00:02:55,337 --> 00:02:58,437
2018年から5年間
For five years since 2018,

3
00:02:58,437 --> 00:03:03,147
通り過ぎてきた たくさんの夜
we've passed through so many nights.

4
00:03:03,407 --> 00:03:08,017
長かったような 短かったような
They felt both so long and so short,

5
00:03:08,017 --> 00:03:15,937
何度でも繰り返したいような 繰り返し…たい…
that I'd want to repeat them over and over...

6
00:03:16,837 --> 00:03:21,177
君はこのループから抜け出したいの？
Do you want to escape from this loop?

7
00:03:30,137 --> 00:03:35,057
聴こえますか 聴こえますか
Can you hear me? Can you hear me?

8
00:03:38,257 --> 00:03:41,137
夜光通信
Nightlight transmission.

9
00:03:45,337 --> 00:03:47,797
ハロー ハロー 聴こえますか
Hello, hello, can you hear me?

10
00:03:48,017 --> 00:03:50,087
そっちは何年？
What year is it on your end?

11
00:03:52,337 --> 00:03:58,117
正しく分かり合う手段はひとつじゃないさ
The right way to understand each other isn't just one.

12
00:03:59,397 --> 00:04:02,947
漂う時間は何処へ行くのか
Where is this drifting time heading?

13
00:04:02,947 --> 00:04:07,137
さよならはいつ誰が決めるの
Who decides when it's time to say goodbye?

14
00:04:07,137 --> 00:04:11,837
その手に触れようと願ってる 本当さ
I'm wishing just to touch your hand, truly.

15
00:04:14,287 --> 00:04:18,157
永遠の夜光 君に歌う
An eternal nightlight, I sing to you.

16
00:04:18,157 --> 00:04:22,097
世界中が君に意地悪でも
Even if the whole world is mean to you,

17
00:04:22,097 --> 00:04:24,897
思い出して 覚えていて
remember it, keep it in mind—

18
00:04:24,897 --> 00:04:29,177
まぶたの裏 ずっとまた会えるからね
behind your eyelids, we'll surely meet again.

19
00:04:29,567 --> 00:04:32,487
穏やかに 健やかに
Calmly, soundly.

20
00:04:33,447 --> 00:04:36,567
君だって 私だって 消えるのは
Whether it's you or me, what fades away

21
00:04:37,387 --> 00:04:43,107
言葉だけ ふんわり君を抱きしめてあげるからね 泣かないで
is just words. I'll gently hold you close, so don't cry.

22
00:04:51,987 --> 00:04:54,817
延々と続く 今日は
Today that goes on and on eternally

23
00:04:54,817 --> 00:04:58,337
誓言のようで 突然の別れまでも
feels like a vow, even unto a sudden parting.

24
00:05:00,328 --> 00:06:01,358
あいも変わらず
Unchanging as always,

25
00:06:01,358 --> 00:06:02,878
上ばかり見ておかしくなる
looking only upward makes me feel strange,

26
00:06:02,878 --> 00:06:04,148
やる気曇っていく
and my motivation clouds over.

27
00:06:04,148 --> 00:06:05,828
責任掛けっせ
Shifting responsibilities,

28
00:06:05,828 --> 00:06:07,458
明日に背を向け
turning my back on tomorrow,

29
00:06:07,458 --> 00:06:09,608
色褪せた過去とやり合ってんだ
I'm dealing with a faded past.

30
00:06:09,608 --> 00:06:13,108
抑え付けるほどかさ増ししていく劣等感 その他諸々
The inferiority complex piles up the more I hold it back, and everything else.

31
00:06:13,108 --> 00:06:15,928
溺れる前に夜を染め上げなくちゃ
I've got to paint the night before I drown.

32
00:06:15,928 --> 00:06:18,958
Flap...Phew!
Flap... Phew!

33
00:06:18,958 --> 00:06:20,658
敵じゃないポーズ決め込んで
Striking a pose like I'm not an enemy,

34
00:06:20,658 --> 00:06:22,428
不満さんポッケ詰め込んで
stuffing my pockets with grievances.

35
00:06:22,428 --> 00:06:24,408
叩き割ったら増える ひたづまひたつ
Smash it open and it multiplies, one by one,

36
00:06:24,408 --> 00:06:26,508
もう飲み込めないくらい
to the point I can't swallow it anymore.

37
00:06:26,508 --> 00:06:29,108
ほらくれてやるよ 食えよ全部
Here, I'll give it to you, eat it all up,

38
00:06:29,108 --> 00:06:30,828
ちゃんと噛んで味わいながら
chewing it properly and savoring the taste.

39
00:06:30,828 --> 00:06:32,408
感想聞いてみてもいいですか
May I ask for your thoughts?

40
00:06:32,408 --> 00:06:35,328
僕ら灰を背負ったままでナイトループだ そう壊れるまで
We're on a night loop carrying ashes, until we break down.

41
00:06:36,888 --> 00:06:39,508
嘘をぎゅっとしたサイコールールじゃ もう縛れないよ
In a psycho rule gripping tight lies, we can't be bound anymore.

42
00:06:39,508 --> 00:06:41,258
正解すら間違えてるんだ
Even the correct answers are mistaken.

43
00:06:41,258 --> 00:06:43,308
そうだろう誰しも彼しも馬鹿みたい
That's right, everyone looks like a fool.

44
00:06:45,108 --> 00:06:47,308
イタイの飛んでいけナイトループだ そう上がれるまで
Let the pain fly away on this night loop, until we can rise up.

45
00:06:49,008 --> 00:06:51,508
やいやいどうしようもないから もう騙さないで
Hey now, there's nothing we can do, so don't deceive me anymore.

46
00:06:52,808 --> 00:06:56,208
あと少しで絶望と希望の境界線 背伸びすれば届きそうな称賛
Just a bit more to the boundary line of despair and hope, praise seemingly in reach if I stand on tiptoe.

47
00:06:56,208 --> 00:06:58,208
うだうだ脱線したい
Rambling and wanting to derail,

48
00:06:58,208 --> 00:07:00,658
うーわって声漏らしちゃって目逸らしちゃって
letting out sighs of "whoa," looking away,

49
00:07:00,658 --> 00:07:02,808
凹み散らすまでがワンセット やる気アンデッド
getting utterly depressed is all part of the set, motivation undead.

50
00:07:02,808 --> 00:07:04,958
毎日がニューな己のバースデイ
Every day is my new personal birthday.

51
00:07:04,958 --> 00:07:07,808
諦めても諦めなくても僕を置いて進んでく時間
Whether I give up or not, time marches on leaving me behind.

52
00:07:23,218 --> 00:07:26,158
残された呼吸を使い果たせば
If we use up the remaining breath,

53
00:07:26,158 --> 00:07:28,928
抱きとめた記憶さえ灰へと散る
even the memories we held onto scatter into ashes.

54
00:07:28,928 --> 00:07:32,108
鼓動とは呪いだと気づきながら
Realizing that a heartbeat is a curse,

55
00:07:32,108 --> 00:07:35,158
参列者は笑い行く 虚ろな棺
the mourners walk away laughing by an empty coffin.

56
00:07:35,158 --> 00:07:37,428
その叫びもやがて過去に溶ける
That cry too will soon melt into the past,

57
00:07:37,428 --> 00:07:39,608
暗室の花だけを道連れに
taking only the flower of the dark room as a companion.

58
00:07:39,608 --> 00:07:42,508
嫌だよ終わるために生まれた悲劇など
I hate it, tragedies born just to end.

59
00:07:42,508 --> 00:07:45,558
息を止めて そのままで 命よ銀に光れ
Stop your breath, stay just as you are, shine in silver, O life!

60
00:07:45,558 --> 00:07:48,358
果たなき夢が いつまでも 続きますように
May this endless dream continue forevermore.

61
00:07:48,358 --> 00:07:51,908
消えたくないよ 消えないで ただそれだけを祈った
I don't want to fade away, don't disappear, I prayed for just that.

62
00:07:51,908 --> 00:07:55,208
最後の最後の幸せ 誰にも誰にも奪わせない 離さない
The very last happiness—I won't let anyone, anyone take it away, I won't let go.

63
00:07:55,208 --> 00:07:59,008
造られた世界は どちらだろうか
Which one is this created world?

64
00:07:59,008 --> 00:08:01,808
目を背け死神に飼われたのは
Looking away and being kept by the reaper,

65
00:08:01,808 --> 00:08:04,858
揺れる火の鮮やかさを持て余す頃
around the time we have more than enough of the flickering flame's brilliance,

66
00:08:04,858 --> 00:08:07,908
白蠟は泣き続ける その結末を
the white wax continues to cry over that ending.

67
00:08:07,908 --> 00:08:10,508
思い出せ 朝を迎えるのはあと何日だろう
Remember, how many days until we welcome the morning?

68
00:08:10,508 --> 00:08:12,758
許された時間はあと何分だろう
How many minutes of granted time do we have left?

69
00:08:12,758 --> 00:08:15,108
この心が満たされるのはあと何秒だろう
How many seconds until this heart is fulfilled?

70
00:08:15,108 --> 00:08:18,408
怖いよ届かずに朽ちてゆくその日が
I'm scared of the day it rots away without reaching anyone.

71
00:08:18,408 --> 00:08:21,008
息を止めて そのままで 命よ銀に光れ
Stop your breath, stay just as you are, shine in silver, O life!

72
00:08:21,008 --> 00:08:23,758
優しい唄が いつまでも 響きますように
May this gentle song echo on forevermore.

73
00:08:23,758 --> 00:08:27,208
悲しみもいつか去るのならいつまでは繰り返そう
If sadness will eventually leave, let's repeat it until when.

74
00:08:27,208 --> 00:08:30,908
こんなにこんなにささやかだ 最後の最後の願いごと
So simple, so humble, this very last wish of mine.

75
00:08:30,908 --> 00:08:34,208
安らかなる 日々だけが 続けばよかった
I wish only peaceful days could go on.

76
