それでも それでも 触れるなら 許さない
Even so, even so, if you reach out, I won't forgive you.

107
00:11:32,979 --> 00:11:35,859
雨、やまないな…
The rain won't stop...

108
00:11:37,349 --> 00:11:38,649
みおちゃーん！
Mio-chan!

109
00:11:39,879 --> 00:11:42,549
あやめ！ こんなとこで何してんの？
Ayame! What are you doing in a place like this?

110
00:11:43,729 --> 00:11:48,089
あやめこそ こんなとこで会うなんて奇遇だね
Of all places, running into you here, Ayame—what a coincidence.

111
00:11:57,559 --> 00:11:59,449
雨、やまないね。
The rain really won't stop.

112
00:12:00,689 --> 00:12:02,209
そうだね…
Yeah, it won't...

113
00:12:05,919 --> 00:12:09,549
雨だけど あやめに会えて嬉しいな
Even though it's raining, I'm so glad I got to see you, Ayame.

114
00:12:10,529 --> 00:12:13,349
あやめ、なんかあった？
Ayame, did something happen?

115
00:12:14,409 --> 00:12:19,479
なんもないよ！ うそうそ！ うちもあやめに会えて嬉しいよ
Nothin' at all! Just kidding! I'm super glad I got to see Ayame too!

116
00:12:20,499 --> 00:12:25,579
もうちょっとお話ししたいな。 うん！
I want to talk a bit more. Yeah!

117
00:12:42,349 --> 00:12:45,349
ああ全然できてないなぁ…
Ah, I'm still not doing very well at all...

118
00:12:45,349 --> 00:12:48,349
漏らす吐息、溜息
Letting out sighs, heavy sighs,

119
00:12:48,349 --> 00:12:53,349
雨音響いていく 午前0時
as the sound of rain echoes at midnight.

120
00:12:53,819 --> 00:12:59,849
明けない夜願っている 少しだけこのままで
Praying for a night that never ends, wishing to stay like this just a little longer.

121
00:12:59,849 --> 00:13:03,949
ココロ、夜と雨の中
My heart is lost in the night and the rain.

122
00:13:04,249 --> 00:13:10,149
揺れる想い まだ整理途中
My wavering feelings are still in the middle of being sorted out.

123
00:13:11,049 --> 00:13:16,149
流れる時間の中
Amidst the flowing passage of time,

124
00:13:18,949 --> 00:13:23,049
明日晴れたらいいな
I hope tomorrow will be clear and sunny.

125
00:13:23,049 --> 00:13:29,849
そんなささやかな 願いごとカタチにして集めよう
Let's gather such small wishes and shape them into reality.

126
00:13:30,349 --> 00:13:34,949
夜照らすムーンライト 空を泳ぐ
Moonlight illuminating the night, swimming through the sky.

127
00:13:35,149 --> 00:13:40,249
顔上げて前へ 踏み出していこう
Lift your head up and take a step forward into the future.

128
00:13:40,849 --> 00:13:45,549
夜と雨の先 出口はまだ
Beyond the night and the rain, the exit is still far away.

129
00:13:49,049 --> 00:13:54,449
ああ全然変わらないな 漏れる軽い微笑み
Ah, nothing has changed at all, as a faint smile slips out.

130
00:13:54,749 --> 00:14:00,349
液晶見つめる 午前3時
Staring at the screen at 3 a.m.

131
00:14:00,349 --> 00:14:06,649
楽しいコト 悲しいコト ひとつに丸めちゃって
Fun things, sad things, rolling them all up into one ball

132
00:14:06,649 --> 00:14:10,849
夜の中に置いておくの
and leaving them behind in the night.

133
00:14:11,149 --> 00:14:16,849
「頑張ろう」とか 「できるよ」とか
Words like \"Do your best\" or \"You can do it\"—

134
00:14:17,649 --> 00:14:22,349
無責任な言葉たち 逆に辛くなるから
those irresponsible words only end up hurting more,

135
00:14:22,349 --> 00:14:28,149
真っ直ぐに進みたいよ
so I just want to walk straight ahead.

136
00:14:28,849 --> 00:14:33,949
流れる時間の中
Amidst the flowing passage of time,

137
00:14:34,049 --> 00:14:36,149
駆けだす
I start running.

138
00:14:37,049 --> 00:14:42,249
明日会えたらどんな顔するかな
What kind of face will I make if I see you tomorrow?

139
00:14:42,549 --> 00:14:47,849
朝日みたいな笑顔で迎えて
Greeting you with a smile like the morning sun,

140
00:14:47,949 --> 00:14:53,349
夜照らすムーンライト 街を眺む
moonlight illuminating the night, gazing out at the town.

141
00:14:53,649 --> 00:14:58,749
悩みすらすっ飛ぶ 見透かすように
As if seeing right through all my worries,

142
00:14:59,049 --> 00:15:01,016
降りやまない雨
the rain keeps falling without stopping.

143
00:15:00,074 --> 00:15:01,224
降り止まないまま
Still not stopping...

144
00:15:01,224 --> 00:15:02,824
夜明けは まだ
Dawn is still far away.

145
00:15:10,024 --> 00:15:15,524
Lalala...

146
00:15:17,224 --> 00:15:21,024
窓に映る景色 雨は宝石で
The scenery in the window, rain like jewels,

147
00:15:21,024 --> 00:15:25,824
夜空は 黒いドレスのようにきらめいて
the night sky glitters like a black dress,

148
00:15:26,024 --> 00:15:28,024
私を照らす
illuminating me.

149
00:15:28,024 --> 00:15:30,524
夜は明けないから
The night will not end,

150
00:15:30,524 --> 00:15:32,824
まだ この夜が好きだから
so I still love this night.

151
00:15:33,224 --> 00:15:41,524
夜と雨に 包まれていく ああ
Enveloped by the night and rain, ah...

152
00:15:43,824 --> 00:15:48,824
明日晴れたらいいな そんなささやかな
"I hope tomorrow is clear"—such a small

153
00:15:49,024 --> 00:15:54,524
願いごとカタチにして 集めよう
wish turned into shape, let's gather them.

154
00:15:55,524 --> 00:15:59,824
夜照らすムーンライト 空を泳ぐ
Moonlight illuminating the night, swimming through the sky,

155
00:16:00,024 --> 00:16:05,524
顔上げて前へ 踏み出していこう
lift your face forward and take a step out.

156
00:16:05,824 --> 00:16:08,524
君と一緒なら 超えたいから
If I'm with you, I want to overcome it,

157
00:16:08,824 --> 00:16:11,524
夢みたいに 言葉でも
like a dream, even in words.

158
00:16:11,824 --> 00:16:15,824
夜と雨の先 明けたら、ほら
Beyond the night and rain, when dawn breaks, look...

159
00:16:36,824 --> 00:16:40,824
あたたかい雪が降る
Warm snow falls

160
00:16:41,024 --> 00:16:45,024
不思議な場所
in this mysterious place.

161
00:16:46,024 --> 00:16:50,024
デジャヴみたい
Like déjà vu,

162
00:16:51,024 --> 00:16:55,524
真っ白な夜
a pure white night

163
00:16:56,024 --> 00:16:59,824
ぽつりと 咲いている
blooming quietly alone,

164
00:17:00,024 --> 00:17:09,024
赤いほほの 私見つけて
find me with my red cheeks.

165
00:17:09,824 --> 00:17:15,024
つかれたね かなしいね もうやめたいね
We're tired, we're sad, we want to stop,

166
00:17:15,224 --> 00:17:27,524
でもふりしぼって 私へとたどりついてくれて ありがとう
but thank you for gathering your strength and reaching me.

167
00:17:29,224 --> 00:17:37,524
あなたを待っていたの ずっとここで
I was waiting for you, right here all along.

168
00:17:38,824 --> 00:17:47,024
世界が目覚めても そばにいさせて
Even if the world wakes up, let me stay by your side.

169
00:17:47,824 --> 00:17:56,024
あなたのために咲くよ ずっとここで
I will bloom for you, right here all along.

170
00:17:57,524 --> 00:18:05,524
春に追いつくされても 覚えていて
Even if spring catches up to us, please remember.

171
00:18:14,024 --> 00:18:18,024
いつの間にか
Before I knew it,

172
00:18:18,524 --> 00:18:23,224
泣き方も忘れてた
I had even forgotten how to cry.

173
00:18:23,524 --> 00:18:27,224
空っぽの箱
An empty box,

174
00:18:27,824 --> 00:18:32,024
ひとりきりだった
all alone.

175
00:18:32,824 --> 00:18:41,224
さみしくて 折れそうで 傷ついても 愛してしまうの
Lonely, ready to break, even when hurt, I end up loving you.

176
00:18:41,824 --> 00:18:49,024
あきらめず 探していてくれて ありがとう
Thank you for searching for me without giving up.

177
00:18:52,024 --> 00:18:59,824
あなたを待っていたの ずっとここで
I was waiting for you, right here all along.

178
00:19:00,224 --> 00:19:05,024
春に追いつくされても 覚えていて
Even if spring catches up to us, please remember.

179
00:19:23,024 --> 00:19:26,524
ひらひら 舞い降りる雪が
The snow fluttering down

180
00:19:26,824 --> 00:19:30,824
やさしいね
is so gentle.

181
00:19:31,224 --> 00:19:40,524
いまこの瞬間 しあわせと名づけさせて
Let me name this very moment "happiness."

182
00:19:41,824 --> 00:19:50,024
あなたのために咲くよ ずっとここで
I will bloom for you, right here all along.

183
00:19:50,524 --> 00:19:59,524
春に追いつくされても 覚えていて
Even if spring catches up to us, please remember.

184
00:20:19,137 --> 00:20:22,037
君に出会うことができて、本当によかった。
I'm so glad I was able to meet you.

185
00:20:22,837 --> 00:20:29,617
これからも、君の居場所になれるように、いつでも、ふっと思い出してもらえるように、
From now on, so I can be your safe place, so you can fondly remember me anytime...

186
00:20:30,037 --> 00:20:32,137
このライブで、咲き続けるからね！
I'll keep blooming in this live!

187
00:20:56,771 --> 00:20:59,751
ねぇ、今日が何の日か覚えてる？
Hey, do you remember what day today is?

188
00:21:00,951 --> 00:21:04,931
そう、うちがホロライブで活動を始めて、5年経ったんだよ！
That's right, it's been 5 years since I started streaming in Hololive!

189
00:21:07,231 --> 00:21:13,971
うーん、いろんなことがあったけど、楽しかったなって思うことの方が多かったかな。
Hmm, a lot has happened, but I feel like there were way more fun moments.

190
00:21:15,831 --> 00:21:19,611
本当だよ！君にも出会うことができたしね。
It's true! I was able to meet you, too.

191
00:21:21,631 --> 00:21:23,671
え、もう行っちゃうの？
Eh, are you leaving already?

192
00:21:25,191 --> 00:21:33,211
そっか、君にも色々あるよね。でも大丈夫、またきっと会えるよ。
I see, you've got a lot going on too. But it's okay, we'll definitely meet again.

193
00:21:35,051 --> 00:21:36,731
またね！
See you!

194
00:21:40,512 --> 00:21:44,212
幽霊東京
[Song: Ghost Tokyo]

195
00:21:56,136 --> 00:21:58,656
燦然と輝く街の灯り
The dazzling lights of the city shine brightly

196
00:21:58,656 --> 00:22:02,096
対照的な僕を見下ろす
Looking down at my contrasting self

197
00:22:02,096 --> 00:22:06,136
あのビルの間を抜けて 色付き出したネオンと混ざって
Slipping between those buildings, mixing with the glowing neon

198
00:22:06,136 --> 00:22:11,276
僕の時間とこの世界をトレード 夜に沈む
Trading my time and this world, sinking into the night

199
00:22:19,136 --> 00:22:23,236
終電で家路を辿る僕の 目に映るガラス窓に居たのは
Tracing my way home on the last train, what was in the glass window

200
00:22:23,236 --> 00:22:26,536
夢見た自分じゃなくて
Wasn't the me I dreamed of being,

201
00:22:26,536 --> 00:22:32,856
今にも泣き出してしまいそうな 暗闇の中独り唯迷っている 哀しい人
A sad person wandering alone in the darkness, about to burst into tears at any moment

202
00:22:33,656 --> 00:22:41,536
大丈夫、いつか大丈夫になるなんて想う日々をいくつ重ねた
How many days have I spent thinking "It'll be alright someday"?

203
00:22:41,936 --> 00:22:50,536
今日だってひとり東京の景色に透ける僕は幽霊みたいだ
Even today, transparent in the scenery of Tokyo all alone, I look just like a ghost.

204
00:22:50,736 --> 00:22:56,416
失うことに慣れていく中で 忘れてしまったあの願いさえも
As I get used to losing things, even that wish I had forgotten

205
00:22:56,416 --> 00:23:01,316
思い出した時に 涙が落ちたのは
When I remembered it, the tears that fell

206
00:23:01,316 --> 00:23:06,336
この街がただ 余りにも眩しいから
Were simply because this city is far too dazzling.

207
00:23:25,136 --> 00:23:32,256
散々だって笑いながら嘆く退屈な日々の中 あの日の想いがフラッシュバック
Laughing and lamenting that it's a mess, the feelings of that day flash back

208
00:23:32,256 --> 00:23:38,116
気付けば朝まで開くロジック 僕の言葉を音に乗せて何度でも
Before I knew it, opening logic until morning, putting my words into sound over and over.

209
00:23:38,356 --> 00:23:43,756
失うことに慣れていく中で 忘れてしまったあの日子でさえも
As I get used to losing things, even those days that I forgot,

210
00:23:43,756 --> 00:23:50,956
それでもまだ先へ なんて思えるのは 君がいるから
Still heading further ahead — the reason I can think that way is because you are here.

211
00:23:51,112 --> 00:23:56,336
ねぇ こんな寂しい街で ねぇ
Hey, in such a lonely city, hey...

212
00:24:09,536 --> 00:24:12,136
燦然と輝く街の灯り
The dazzling lights of the city shine brightly

213
00:24:12,136 --> 00:24:15,436
対照的な僕を見下ろす
Looking down at my contrasting self

214
00:24:15,436 --> 00:24:19,756
あのビルの先 手を伸ばして あの日夢見た景色をなぞって
Reaching out my hand beyond those buildings, tracing the scenery I dreamed of that day

215
00:24:19,756 --> 00:24:24,956
僕の時間とこの世界をトレード 明日を呼ぶ
Trading my time and this world, calling for tomorrow.

216
00:24:25,936 --> 00:24:31,616
失うことに慣れていく中で 失わずにいた大事な想いを
As I get used to losing things, embracing those precious feelings I didn't lose,

217
00:24:31,616 --> 00:24:36,716
抱きしめたらふいに 涙が落ちたのは
When I hugged them, suddenly the tears that fell,

218
00:24:36,716 --> 00:24:42,736
この街でまだ 生きていたいと思うから 君もそうでしょう
Because I still want to live in this city — you think so too, right?

219
00:25:08,583 --> 00:25:12,483
真夜中 流れれてく
Flowing through the midnight,

220
00:25:12,845 --> 00:25:16,265
ビルをなぞって 消える
tracing the buildings and disappearing.

221
00:25:19,645 --> 00:25:21,045
どこへゆくの？
Where are you heading?

222
00:25:21,785 --> 00:25:29,645
変わってゆくこと 気づいて 立ちどまった
I noticed things changing and stopped in my tracks.

223
00:25:30,205 --> 00:25:36,905
曖昧で不確かなもの 終わりあることだから
Because ambiguous and uncertain things eventually come to an end—

224
00:25:38,805 --> 00:25:47,205
私は此処にある 君といる時間の中で 呼吸をするんでしょう
I am right here, breathing within the time spent with you.

225
00:25:48,065 --> 00:25:58,105
変わらないで、と 終わらないで、と 今日も 夜明けを噛む
Saying \"don't change,\" saying \"don't ever end,\" I bite into the dawn once again today.

226
00:26:06,485 --> 00:26:07,765
「輝いていたい」 こんな世界で憂う私を どうか寝かさないで
\"I want to shine.\" Please don't let me sleep, me who grieves in a world like this.

227
00:26:08,525 --> 00:26:16,145
君の隣で溶けて消えるまで 生きて
Live, until I melt and fade away right beside you.

228
00:26:16,885 --> 00:26:25,505
揺らいだ切なさは いつかの朝に似てる
This wavering sorrow resembles a certain morning.

229
00:26:27,645 --> 00:26:33,145
「ひとりじゃない」 眩さの中 確かに触れた
\"I'm not alone\"—I touched it for sure within the brilliance.

230
00:26:35,765 --> 00:26:45,625
心の片隅 君の瞳に映る私を 焼き付けて
Burn into me the image of myself reflected in your eyes, in the corner of my heart.

231
00:27:14,645 --> 00:27:23,285
その手で抱きしめて きっと誰よりも強く輝けるでしょう
Embrace me in your hands; I'm sure I can shine brighter than anyone.

232
00:27:26,885 --> 00:27:36,365
変わりゆくもの 終わりゆくもの ひとつ またたくように
Things that change, things that end—like a single twinkling light.

233
00:27:37,765 --> 00:27:47,225
「確かめていたい」 霞む世界に歌う私を どうか忘れないで
\"I want to be sure\"—please don't forget me, singing in a hazy world.

234
00:27:47,925 --> 00:27:59,725
君の記憶の底へ 淡く甘く 滲んで ひとつになって ただようだけ
Into the depths of your memory, softly and sweetly bleeding, becoming one, just drifting along.

235
00:28:00,525 --> 00:28:06,545
泣き出しそうな 夜の隙間を縫って
Sewing through the gaps of a night that looks ready to cry,

236
00:28:07,425 --> 00:28:16,885
私は往く 夜明けのメロウ 君の隣で溶けて消えるまで 生きて
I walk on, the melody of dawn. Live, until I melt and vanish by your side.

237
00:28:27,333 --> 00:28:28,913
待ってたよ、
You've been waiting, haven't you?

238
00:28:30,353 --> 00:28:31,233
たくさん。
A lot.

239
00:28:32,473 --> 00:28:41,033
みおさ、ファーストアルバムが出せるってなったとき、相当嬉しかったんだよ。
When it was decided that I could release my first album, Mio was so, so happy.

240
00:28:41,953 --> 00:28:48,113
歌うことは大好きだったけど、自信が正直なかったからさ、
I always loved singing, but honestly I didn't have much confidence, so...

241
00:28:49,733 --> 00:28:58,093
もう、これ以上うまく歌えることはないだろうなって、勝手に思っちゃっててさ。
I kind of just assumed, \"Well, I probably won't ever be able to sing any better than this.\"

242
00:28:59,733 --> 00:29:04,953
でもね、君が待っててくれたから、
But you know, because you waited for me,

243
00:29:06,153 --> 00:29:15,073
うまくならないって思ってたのに、なんか成長したなって思うんだよね。
even though I thought I wouldn't get any better, somehow I feel like I've grown.

244
00:29:17,573 --> 00:29:22,813
より一層歌が好きになれたんだ。
I've come to love singing even more than before.

245
00:29:24,673 --> 00:29:32,253
気づかせてくれたのは、君だよ。
And the one who made me realize that is you.

246
00:29:52,733 --> 00:29:56,033
何処まで往こうか ネイビな夜空に
How far shall I go into the navy night sky?

247
00:29:56,973 --> 00:30:00,613
映る昨日の自分 夢見がちだった
The past self reflected there was so prone to dreaming.

248
00:30:01,429 --> 00:30:02,929
ベイビーフェイスに
To your baby face,

249
00:30:02,929 --> 00:30:04,229
サヨナラ？
goodbye?

250
00:30:04,899 --> 00:30:07,449
見たくないモノ照らすハイビームに
In the high beams illuminating what I don't want to see,

251
00:30:08,879 --> 00:30:11,349
走る焦燥感 跳ね除けて前へ往けば
a rushing impatience—if I brush it aside and press forward,

252
00:30:13,869 --> 00:30:16,689
信号は皆 色を無くし消えた
all the traffic lights lost their colors and vanished.

253
00:30:19,179 --> 00:30:20,779
確かめたい
I want to confirm

254
00:30:20,779 --> 00:30:24,509
この道が繋ぐ場所を
where this road leads.

255
00:30:25,969 --> 00:30:28,779
深く、深く紺になる
Deeply, deeply turning deep indigo.

256
00:30:28,779 --> 00:30:31,689
夜を往ける この加速度
This acceleration traversing the night,

257
00:30:31,819 --> 00:30:36,079
光さえ超えてゆける程に
to the extent that I can surpass even light itself.

258
00:30:37,749 --> 00:30:43,259
強く、強く踏み込んで僕は駆ける ただ真っ直ぐに
Stepping down fiercely, fiercely, I run straight ahead.

259
00:30:43,609 --> 00:30:48,139
譲れない想いを抱いて
Holding onto unyielding feelings.

260
00:31:02,639 --> 00:31:05,909
標識だらけの街を抜け出して
Breaking out of the signpost-filled town,

261
00:31:06,339 --> 00:31:08,209
未来を探してた
I was searching for the future.

262
00:31:08,579 --> 00:31:13,199
常識も何も 全部 雑多と化してた
Common sense and everything else had turned into clutter.

263
00:31:14,829 --> 00:31:20,219
何処まで往けるの なんて聞き飽いた台詞吐いて
Uttering that tired line, "How far can you go?"

264
00:31:20,739 --> 00:31:27,219
曇った窓ガラスに書いた本音 すぐに指で消した
The true feelings written on the foggy windowpane, I erased with my finger instantly.

265
00:31:28,919 --> 00:31:32,179
臆病でも 揺るぎない軌跡
Even if cowardly, an unshakable trace,

266
00:31:33,249 --> 00:31:38,249
確かな願いを 胸に 遥か遠く
a certain wish in my chest, far, far away.

267
00:31:38,649 --> 00:31:43,879
錆び付くように軋んでも この真っ暗を灯し進む
Even if creaking as if rusting, I push forward lighting up this pitch blackness.

268
00:31:44,959 --> 00:31:49,249
ただ一つ 答えを追いかけて
Chasing after just one answer.

269
00:31:50,729 --> 00:31:55,429
脆くてもいい この腕で掴む為に手を伸ばすよ
Even if frail, I reach out my hands to grasp it with these arms.

270
00:31:56,999 --> 00:32:01,619
打ち鳴らす鼓動の限り
To the limit of my beating heart.

271
00:32:27,539 --> 00:32:33,089
何度 この道で迷って 見失って どこへ往くの
How many times, getting lost on this road, losing sight, where am I going?

272
00:32:38,029 --> 00:32:45,349
目指す場所も その意味も 一つしか無いのに 曇った視界は
Even though there's only one destination and one meaning, my clouded vision

273
00:32:48,089 --> 00:32:53,169
夜に溶けて もう一度 ひらけてゆく
melts into the night and opens up once again.

274
00:32:54,089 --> 00:33:00,029
視線の先 僕を連れて往くよ きっと
Ahead of my gaze, it will surely lead me away.

275
00:33:03,829 --> 00:33:06,769
深く、深く紺になる
Deeply, deeply turning deep indigo,

276
00:33:06,769 --> 00:33:09,869
息を吸って 今 加速を
taking a breath, now accelerating.

277
00:33:10,059 --> 00:33:14,669
傷付く程に強くなると 確かな色 動き出す
As I grow stronger the more I get hurt, true colors begin to move.

278
00:33:18,139 --> 00:33:25,859
纏ってゆく その身体で 鮮やかな夜空の果てへ 忘れないように
Clothed in that body, toward the edge of the vibrant night sky, so I won't forget.

279
00:33:28,179 --> 00:33:33,999
深く、深く紺になれ 今を生きる この加速度 光だって超えてゆける場所へ
Deeply, deeply become deep indigo, this acceleration living in the present, to a place where I can surpass even light.

280
00:33:39,869 --> 00:33:45,089
強く、強く踏み込んで僕は駆ける ただ真っ直ぐに
Stepping down fiercely, fiercely, I run straight ahead.

281
00:33:46,739 --> 00:33:50,279
譲れない想いを抱いて
Holding onto unyielding feelings.

282
00:33:50,799 --> 00:33:56,879
止まらないで 走り続く意味を知るから
Don't stop, because I know the meaning of continuing to run.

283
00:34:10,354 --> 00:34:16,254
わくわくエブリデイ
[Title: Wakuwaku Everyday]

284
00:34:23,954 --> 00:34:27,254
心地よい晴れ空
A pleasant, clear sky,

285
00:34:27,254 --> 00:34:30,754
今日は何をして遊ぼうか
what should we play today?

286
00:34:30,874 --> 00:34:36,874
いつまでも変わらない 雲を追いかけてみようか
Shall we chase the clouds that never change?

287
00:34:37,434 --> 00:34:40,634
はしゃぎ回って 疲れて
Running around and getting tired,

288
00:34:40,704 --> 00:34:43,754
お腹もすいて 寝転んで
getting hungry and lying down.

289
00:34:43,954 --> 00:34:48,134
明日はもっといい日になりそう 一緒だよ
Tomorrow looks like it'll be an even better day, we're together!

290
00:34:49,754 --> 00:34:55,154
いつもキラキラ毎日止まらないでしょ
Every day sparkles brightly and never stops, right?

291
00:34:55,354 --> 00:34:59,754
やりたいこと全部遊び尽くしても
Even if we play out everything we want to do,

292
00:35:00,997 --> 00:35:02,537
やりたいこと全部遊び尽くしても
Even if we play and exhaust everything we want to do,

293
00:35:02,817 --> 00:35:09,537
今はまだ知らないこと沢山あるけど
There are still so many things we don't know yet,

294
00:35:09,877 --> 00:35:12,607
君と君と手を取って
Taking each other's hands,

295
00:35:12,607 --> 00:35:17,257
ずっと笑えるといいよね
I hope we can keep smiling forever.

296
00:35:30,023 --> 00:35:36,233
朝まで語り込んで眠くなる日もあったよね
There were days we talked until morning and got sleepy,

297
00:35:36,553 --> 00:35:43,373
些細な悩みさえも笑いに変えてくれたよね
And turned even the smallest worries into laughter.

298
00:35:43,673 --> 00:35:49,853
たまに怒ってうつむいて 励まし合って乗り越えて
Sometimes getting angry and looking down, encouraging each other—

299
00:35:49,853 --> 00:35:55,693
一人じゃできないことでも二人なら
Even things we couldn't do alone, together—

300
00:35:55,693 --> 00:36:01,453
ほらね？ワクワクすること止まらないでしょ
See? The excitement just won't stop, right?

301
00:36:01,453 --> 00:36:08,273
やりたいこと叶える力があるよ
We have the power to make our dreams come true.

302
00:36:08,273 --> 00:36:15,433
そうでしょう？ときめくココロに色づく毎日
Right? Every day colors our throbbing hearts.

303
00:36:15,893 --> 00:36:23,783
君と君と手を取って「今」を重ね続けてこう
Taking each other's hands, let's keep stacking up 'now'.

304
00:36:24,143 --> 00:36:28,553
笑顔の帰り道も
On the way home full of smiles too,

305
00:36:28,553 --> 00:36:34,775
何年経っても 君となら ずっと…
No matter how many years pass, with you, forever...

306
00:36:49,643 --> 00:36:55,903
いつまでだって続くんだ どこまでだって行けそうだ
It will go on forever, we feel like we can go anywhere.

307
00:36:55,903 --> 00:37:02,163
友達なんて言葉じゃまだ足りないよ
Words like 'friends' are still not enough.

308
00:37:02,163 --> 00:37:08,843
いつもそばで支えてくれてありがとう
Thank you for always supporting me by my side.

309
00:37:08,843 --> 00:37:15,323
一緒に笑い合ってくれてありがとう
Thank you for sharing laughs together with me.

310
00:37:15,323 --> 00:37:22,283
今はまだ知らないこと沢山あるけど
There are still so many things we don't know yet,

311
00:37:22,283 --> 00:37:31,733
君と君と手を取って 転んで泣きそうな時も 君と君と明日も
Taking each other's hands, even when we stumble and might cry, with you tomorrow too—

312
00:37:31,843 --> 00:37:36,573
ずっと笑えるといいよね
I hope we can keep smiling forever.

313
00:37:36,573 --> 00:37:44,983
これからもね よろしくどうぞ
Here's to looking forward to our future together!

314
00:37:59,600 --> 00:38:08,280
皆さんお待ちかね！活動5周年記念フルセット、記念グッズはこちらとなっております！
Everyone, you've been waiting for it! The 5th anniversary full set and commemorative goods are right here!

315
00:38:08,600 --> 00:38:18,280
はい、こんな感じのフルセットですね。いやあ泉パパのイラストが今回も光っております。
Yes, it's a full set like this. Oh, Izumi-papa's illustrations are shining bright this time too.

316
00:38:18,700 --> 00:38:24,280
では一個ずつグッズを紹介させてもらいます！まずは泉パパ描き下ろしのパブミラー！
Now let's introduce the goods one by one! First, the pub mirror illustrated by Izumi-papa!

317
00:38:24,460 --> 00:38:38,560
パブミラーって一体なんだって思ってる人も結構多いと思うんですけど、パブミラーは、イラストの背景が鏡になってて高級感があって特別な感じのインテリアみたいな感じなのかな？
I think quite a few people might be wondering what a pub mirror actually is, but the background of the illustration is a mirror, giving it a luxurious, special kind of interior feel.

318
00:38:38,860 --> 00:38:48,560
で、今回アクリルスタンドとはまた別に高級感、特別感を出したくてパブミラーを出してみました！皆さんのご自宅に飾ってみてください！
And this time, separate from the acrylic stand, I wanted to bring out that luxurious and special feeling, so I decided to release a pub mirror! Please display it in your homes!

319
00:38:49,160 --> 00:38:54,560
そしてお次が、ミオシャとおでかけコインケース！
And next, Mio-sha's Outing Coin Case!

320
00:38:54,760 --> 00:39:14,560
こちらはみんながイベントに行く時に、よくコインを使うんじゃないかと思って、そのコインを出し入れするためだけのコインケースがあったら便利なんじゃないかなと思い作ってみました！このコインケースと一緒にイベントに行ってくれたらうちはとっても嬉しいなー！
I thought people often use coins when going to events, so I made this coin case just for taking coins in and out! I'd be so happy if you went to events with this coin case!

321
00:39:15,160 --> 00:39:20,260
はい、ではお次、ミオシャ思い出フォトフレーム！
Yes, next up, the Mio-sha Memories Photo Frame!

322
00:39:20,460 --> 00:39:39,060
こちらはうちがいつも特典でつけてるポストカードを入れるのにちょうどいい感じのフォトフレームを作ってみました！またね、この鹿テナ先生の描き下ろしなんですけどコインケースもね描き下ろししていただいたんですが、とっても可愛いですね！
I made this photo frame sized just right for putting in the postcards I always give as bonuses! Also, this is illustrated by Shikaten-sensei—the coin case was also drawn by them, and it's so cute!

323
00:39:39,360 --> 00:39:45,060
ぜひぜひこちらのの中にポストカードを飾ってお家で眺めてみてくださいね！
Please definitely display your postcards inside this and admire them at home!

324
00:39:46,160 --> 00:39:50,560
はい、そして最後が、ミオファの森の住民カード！
Yes, and finally, the Miofa Forest Resident Card!

325
00:39:50,760 --> 00:39:59,775
こちらはですね、ミオファの森の住民のみんなが、ミオファの森内での身分証明書に使えるように作ってみました！何言ってるのか
This is something I made so that all residents of Miofa Forest can use it as an ID within Miofa Forest! What am I saying...

326
00:40:00,836 --> 00:40:02,676
よくわかんないと思うけどね、
You probably don't get it yet, but

327
00:40:02,956 --> 00:40:07,796
はい、ちなみにシリアル番号は、えっと、それぞれ入っているんですけれども、
Right, by the way, each one has a serial number,

328
00:40:07,796 --> 00:40:17,616
えーシリアル番号が全員が違うので、世界に1つだけ、1枚だけのカードとなっておりますので、ぜひミオファの皆はゲットしてみてください。
but since every serial number is different, it's a one-of-a-kind card in the world, so Miofa, please be sure to get yours.

329
00:40:18,176 --> 00:40:25,756
そして、最後にこのグッズのフルセットを買ってもらうと、特典が2つあります！
And finally, if you buy the full set of these goods, there are two special bonuses!

330
00:40:25,896 --> 00:40:36,596
大神ミオ直筆サイン＆箔押し複製メッセージ入りポストカード、泉見パパ描き下ろしのポストカード！イェイ！長ーい！長ーい！
A postcard with Mio's handwritten signature and foil-stamped message, and one by Izumi-papa! Yay! So long!

331
00:40:37,496 --> 00:40:45,696
えーと、うちが、えー直筆のサインを入れて、さらに箔押しの、箔押しじゃない、箔押しのメッセージが入ったポストカードとなっておりまーす。
Um, with my handwritten signature and a foil-stamped message added to it.

332
00:40:45,896 --> 00:40:54,696
泉見パパのイラストで、さっきのパブミラーのイラストなんだけど、ちょっと差分で表情が違ったりするので、ぜひぜひこちらも手に入れてください。
It's Izumi-papa's illustration—same as the pub mirror, but with a slightly different expression, so please get this too!

333
00:40:55,136 --> 00:41:04,976
そして、お次が、えー特典2つ目！特典ボイス、えー5周年のあと君と一緒に！というテーマでシチュエーションボイスを撮らせていただきましたー！
And next, the second bonus! A bonus voice situation recorded with the theme "Together with you after 5 years"!

334
00:41:05,196 --> 00:41:19,236
もうちょっといつもね、あのボイス取るの少し恥ずかしいんだけれども、5年間一緒に過ごしてくれたみんなに感謝の気持ちを込めて、えーシチュエーションボイス台本から考えたので、ぜひぜひちょっと恥ずかしいですが聞いてくださーい！
It's a bit embarrassing for me to record voice packs, but with gratitude to everyone who spent 5 years with me, I wrote the script myself, so please listen!

335
00:41:20,256 --> 00:41:21,876
はあー。
*sigh*

336
00:41:22,696 --> 00:41:26,056
さて、グッズ告知も終わったね。
Now then, the goods announcement is done.

337
00:41:26,656 --> 00:41:30,196
けど、なんかもの足りないな。
But, something feels a bit lacking.

338
00:41:31,356 --> 00:41:34,996
君もなんか短いなって思ってない？
Don't you think it feels a bit short too?

339
00:41:36,116 --> 00:41:42,776
ああ、そっか！もの足りないならもう1回5年目いっとく？
Ah, I see! If it's lacking, shall we go through year 5 once more?

340
00:41:45,516 --> 00:41:56,556
ここだけの話、ライブのタイトルのナイトループってあるじゃん？あれって気づいてたかもしれないけど、曲名なんだよね。
Just between us, you know the live title "Night Loop"? You might have noticed, but that's the song title.

341
00:41:59,056 --> 00:42:06,236
この夢のようなライブが終わったあとに、なんとMVも公開されちゃいます！
After this dream-like live concert ends, amazingly, the MV will also be released!

342
00:42:07,116 --> 00:42:12,576
じゃあ心の準備はいい？いくよ！ナイトループ！
Well, are you ready? Here we go! Night Loop!

343
00:42:27,876 --> 00:42:30,076
相変わらず絵ばかり見ておかしくなる
Still staring at pictures and going crazy,

344
00:42:30,076 --> 00:42:31,616
やりたくもないって言ってさ
saying I don't want to do this,

345
00:42:31,616 --> 00:42:34,376
積み重ねてく明日に背を向け 色褪せた過去とやり合ってんだ
turning my back on piling-up tomorrows, fighting a faded past.

346
00:42:34,476 --> 00:42:37,876
抑えつけるほどにかさ増していく劣等感 その場しのぎのガラクタもろもろ
The inferiority complex and makeshift junk piling up the more I suppress it—

347
00:42:37,876 --> 00:42:40,716
こぼれる前に夜を染め上げなきゃ
I have to dye the night before it overflows.

348
00:42:48,136 --> 00:42:49,996
できっこないポーズ決め込んで
Striking poses that can't be done,

349
00:42:49,996 --> 00:42:51,636
満身創痍で詰め込んで
packing it all in while battered and bruised,

350
00:42:51,636 --> 00:42:55,056
叩き終わったバブル一つ一つも飲み込めないくらい
so much that I can't even swallow each popped bubble one by one.

351
00:42:55,056 --> 00:42:58,996
ほらくれてやるよ食えよ全部ちゃんと噛んで味わいながら
Look, I'll give it to you, eat it all, chewing and savoring it properly.

352
00:42:59,336 --> 00:43:02,676
感想聞いてみてもいいですか
May I ask for your thoughts?

353
00:43:03,516 --> 00:43:05,896
僕ら灰を背負ったままナイトループだ
We carry our ashes as we do the night loop,

354
00:43:05,896 --> 00:43:09,916
そう 壊れるまで
yes, until we break.

355
00:43:09,916 --> 00:43:14,276
運命をぎゅっとしたサイコロルールじゃ もう縛れないよ
With dice rules squeezing fate tight, we can no longer be bound.

356
00:43:14,276 --> 00:43:18,176
正解すら間違っているんだそうだろ 誰も彼もバカみたい
Even the correct answers are wrong, aren't they? Everyone's like a fool.

357
00:43:18,176 --> 00:43:20,596
痛いの飛んでいけ ナイトループだ
Pain, fly away! It's a night loop,

358
00:43:20,596 --> 00:43:23,476
そう 上がれるまで
yes, until we can rise.

359
00:43:23,476 --> 00:43:25,896
やいのやいのどうしようもないから
Making a fuss because there's nothing we can do,

360
00:43:25,896 --> 00:43:31,296
もう語らないで あと少しで 絶望と希望の境界線 背伸びすれば届きそうだな
stop talking now, just a little more and the boundary of despair and hope—if I stretch on tiptoe, I might reach it.

361
00:43:32,316 --> 00:43:38,116
うだうだうだ 脱線したい
Fidgeting, wanting to derail.

362
00:43:38,116 --> 00:43:46,116
うだうだうだ 脱線したい
Fidgeting, wanting to derail.

363
00:43:47,196 --> 00:43:49,996
うわって声も漏らしちゃって 目逸らしちゃって
Letting out cries of "Whoa", looking away,

364
00:43:49,996 --> 00:43:52,136
へこみ散らすまでがワンセット
getting thoroughly depressed is all part of the set.

365
00:43:52,136 --> 00:43:54,736
やりきりアンダー 毎日がニューな己のバースデイ
Push through it, under—every day is my own new birthday.

366
00:43:54,736 --> 00:43:57,416
諦めても諦めなくても僕を置いて進んでく時間
Whether I give up or not, time moves on, leaving me behind.

367
00:43:57,416 --> 00:44:00,696
抜け出せないなら乗るしかないじゃん しゃあないなあ
If I can't escape, I have no choice but to ride along, oh well.

368
00:44:00,876 --> 00:44:04,316
湧いてこうぜほらナイトループだ もう止まらないね
Boil up, hey, it's a night loop, it won't stop anymore!

369
00:44:04,316 --> 00:44:07,316
変になったのどっちなんだかさっぱりわからないね
I have no idea which of us became strange.

370
00:44:07,316 --> 00:44:10,956
明後日前で巻き戻って期待の延長戦
Rewinding to the day after tomorrow, an extended match of expectations—

371
00:44:10,956 --> 00:44:14,456
1か8か3か夜か
one or eight, three or night,

372
00:44:14,456 --> 00:44:18,416
最後に笑うためなら幾らだって泣いて抗おうか
if it's so I can laugh at the end, I'll cry as much as it takes and fight back.

373
00:44:18,416 --> 00:44:22,156
元の自分が未来から手を振っている
My former self is waving from the future.

374
00:44:22,156 --> 00:44:25,836
行こうぜ向こうの先へ ああ I'm happy
Let's go beyond yonder—ah, I'm happy.

375
00:44:25,836 --> 00:44:28,956
まだ夜は明けない 燻るネオンサイン
The night still hasn't broken, smoldering neon signs—

376
00:44:28,956 --> 00:44:32,756
不安掻き消そうぜ
let's blow away the anxiety!

377
00:44:32,756 --> 00:44:35,956
まだ夢は覚めない 笑う疑問符
The dream still hasn't awakened, laughing question marks—

378
00:44:35,956 --> 00:44:39,756
今打ち消そうぜ
let's erase them now!

379
00:44:40,796 --> 00:44:43,196
僕ら灰を背負ったままナイトループだ
We carry our ashes as we do the night loop,

380
00:44:43,196 --> 00:44:47,196
そう 壊れるまで
yes, until we break.

381
00:44:47,196 --> 00:44:50,876
運命をぎゅっとしたサイコロルールじゃ もう縛れないよ
With dice rules squeezing fate tight, we can no longer be bound.

382
00:44:50,876 --> 00:44:54,796
正解すら間違っているんだそうだろ 誰も彼もバカみたい
Even the correct answers are wrong, aren't they? Everyone's like a fool.

383
00:44:54,796 --> 00:44:57,376
痛いの飛んでいけ ナイトループだ
Pain, fly away! It's a night loop,

384
00:44:57,376 --> 00:44:59,976
そう 上がれるまで
yes, until we can rise.

385
00:44:59,976 --> 00:45:00,796
やいのやいのどうしようもないから
Making a fuss because there's nothing we can do—

386
00:45:00,899 --> 00:45:02,369
もう騙さないで
Don't trick me anymore

387
00:45:02,629 --> 00:45:03,859
あと少しで
Just a little bit more

388
00:45:03,859 --> 00:45:05,919
絶望と希望の境界線
The boundary line of despair and hope

389
00:45:05,919 --> 00:45:09,329
背伸びすれば届きそうな称賛
Praise that seems within reach if I stretch

390
00:45:16,959 --> 00:45:18,209
うだうだ
Moping around,

391
00:45:18,209 --> 00:45:19,479
うだうだ
moaning and groaning,

392
00:45:19,479 --> 00:45:20,799
うだうだ
complaining endlessly,

393
00:45:20,799 --> 00:45:22,099
うだうだ
moping around...

394
00:45:22,099 --> 00:45:23,379
脱線したい
I want to derail.

395
00:45:24,899 --> 00:45:25,719
ループ
Loop

396
00:45:34,067 --> 00:45:38,567
2018年から5年間 通り過ぎてきた たくさんの夜
For five years since 2018, I've passed through countless nights.

397
00:45:41,817 --> 00:45:45,817
長かったような 短かったような
It felt so long, yet so short.

398
00:45:46,817 --> 00:45:53,317
何度でも繰り返したいような 繰り返したい…
Something I'd want to repeat over and over again... want to repeat...

399
00:45:54,817 --> 00:45:57,817
君はこのループから抜け出したい？
Do you want to escape from this loop?

400
00:46:06,817 --> 00:46:13,817
君はこのループを抜け出すことを選んだんだね。
You chose to break out of this loop, didn't you.

401
00:46:15,817 --> 00:46:16,817
そっか。
I see.

402
00:46:17,817 --> 00:46:21,817
じゃあ、うちと6年目を始めよう！
Then, let's start year six together!

403
00:46:23,817 --> 00:46:25,817
なんかワクワクしてきた。
I'm starting to get excited.

404
00:46:27,817 --> 00:46:30,817
最後にもう1曲だけ、
Just one last song,

405
00:46:30,817 --> 00:46:32,817
アンコール、聴いてね。
an encore, please listen.

406
00:46:35,317 --> 00:46:36,817
シリウス。
Sirius.

407
00:46:41,217 --> 00:46:47,217
ごめんね ありがとう 声に出して見ても
I'm sorry, thank you, even when I say it out loud,

408
00:46:47,817 --> 00:46:53,817
届かない 戻らない あの日の僕らは
it doesn't reach, it won't return, we of that day

409
00:46:53,817 --> 00:47:02,817
繋ぎ手繋いで 朝に怯えて震えていた
held hands tightly, trembling in fear of the morning.

410
00:47:07,817 --> 00:47:13,817
失わないで、と 消えないで、と 願っても
Even wishing "Don't lose it," "Don't fade away,"

411
00:47:14,817 --> 00:47:20,817
色褪せてゆく 記憶の破片 抱きしめ
clutching the fading fragments of memory,

412
00:47:22,817 --> 00:47:26,817
眠るよ 「逢いたい」
I sleep. "I want to see you,"

413
00:47:27,817 --> 00:47:32,817
ただ、願うほどに 目を閉じて
the more I simply wish, the more I close my eyes,

414
00:47:32,817 --> 00:47:40,817
醒めないで 深い憂夢の中 いつかの君を探している
and in the deep, unawakening dream, I keep searching for you of someday.

415
00:47:41,817 --> 00:47:47,817
僕はまだ あの夜を 独りで歩こう
I will still walk that night alone.

416
00:47:58,817 --> 00:48:03,817
呼吸も 温度も 失した世界に
In a world that lost both breath and warmth,

417
00:48:04,817 --> 00:48:10,817
約束は 今も 美しいままで
our promise remains as beautiful as ever,

418
00:48:11,817 --> 00:48:19,817
夜空に咲いている 君の声だけ 聞こえないよ
blooming in the night sky. Only your voice, I cannot hear.

419
00:48:22,817 --> 00:48:30,817
ここにいるのに 叫ぶのに 夜はまた隠してしまう
Even though I'm here, even though I shout, the night hides it away again

420
00:48:33,817 --> 00:48:40,817
優しい嘘で 包んで どうかして
wrapped in a gentle lie, please somehow

421
00:48:44,817 --> 00:48:50,817
またあした、とも 言えないいまは
right now, when I can't even say "See you tomorrow,"

422
00:48:51,817 --> 00:49:05,817
彼方へとゆく 君を想うよ もう一度だけ 笑いかけて
I think of you heading into the distance. Just smile at me one more time,

423
00:49:05,817 --> 00:49:11,817
きっとまた それだけで 僕は
surely, just that would be enough for me.

424
00:49:12,817 --> 00:49:18,817
待っていた 季節が解けるように
As if the waiting season is thawing,

425
00:49:19,817 --> 00:49:24,817
やがて 夜は明けるから
before long, the night will break,

426
00:49:25,817 --> 00:49:31,817
動き出す 時が二人を遠く離れても
and time moves on, even if it separates us far apart,

427
00:49:34,817 --> 00:49:41,817
心は繋げて
our hearts stay connected.

428
00:50:13,268 --> 00:50:15,948
サヨナラは、まだ
"Goodbyes are still..."

429
00:50:15,948 --> 00:50:19,828
こぼれた涙は
The spilled tears

430
00:50:20,328 --> 00:50:26,368
君がゆく あの空を飾るよ
will adorn the sky where you go.

431
00:50:26,368 --> 00:50:33,248
迷わないように輝いてて
Shine on so you won't lose your way.

432
00:50:33,248 --> 00:50:41,688
いつまでも忘れない君を追うよ
I will chase after you, never forgetting.

433
00:50:42,088 --> 00:50:48,168
明日も歌うよ
I'll sing tomorrow too,

434
00:50:48,168 --> 00:50:53,628
明日を
sing of tomorrow.

435
00:50:53,908 --> 00:51:00,908
愛しいと願うほどに
The more I yearn and wish for it,

436
00:51:00,908 --> 00:51:06,848
僕らがまた巡り会う日まで
until the day we meet again,

437
00:51:06,848 --> 00:51:14,088
おやすみ
goodnight.

438
00:51:35,094 --> 00:51:37,974
相変わらずえばかりに手をおかしくなるやりくり持ってく
Still putting on airs, struggling with awkward management,

439
00:51:37,974 --> 00:51:41,974
責任かげこわすに目を向け色あせた過去とやり合ってんだ
fencing with a faded past while turning a blind eye to responsibility.

440
00:51:41,974 --> 00:51:45,754
抑えつけるほどにかさを増していく劣等感 その他諸々
An inferiority complex that grows the more you suppress it, and all the rest.

441
00:51:45,754 --> 00:51:49,654
浸る前に夜を染め上げなくちゃ Flap...Phew!
We've got to dye the night before we drown in it! Flap... Phew!

442
00:51:49,654 --> 00:51:52,774
敵じゃないほうで決め込んで
Deciding on the non-enemy side,

443
00:51:52,774 --> 00:51:56,074
端からぽけ詰め込んで
stuffing our pockets from the edge,

444
00:51:56,074 --> 00:52:00,234
叩き合ったらば増える一つ又一つ飲み込めないくらい
beating each other up makes them pile up one by one, more than we can swallow.

445
00:52:00,234 --> 00:52:03,674
ほらくれてやるよ食えよ全部ちゃんと噛んで味わいながら
Here, I'll give it to you, eat it all up, chewing properly and savoring it.

446
00:52:03,674 --> 00:52:07,694
感想聞いてみてもいいですか
Would it be okay to ask for your thoughts?

447
00:52:07,694 --> 00:52:12,594
期待の飛んでいけないグループだ そうあがれるまで
We're a group that can't fly on expectations, until we can rise up like this.

448
00:52:12,594 --> 00:52:17,734
やいのやいのどうしょうもないから もう語らないで
There's no point in all the fuss, so stop talking already.

449
00:52:17,734 --> 00:52:25,334
あと少しで絶望と希望の境界線 背伸びすれば届きそうな超再生
Just a bit more to the boundary of despair and hope, super regeneration within reach if we stretch.

450
00:52:25,334 --> 00:52:29,334
いつも応援してくれているミオファのみんな
To all the Miofa who always support me,

